# Data Analyst Project Builder

When working on portfolio projects in this repo, prioritize **case study quality for hiring managers**.

## File location

- New projects: `content/projects/<slug>.md`
- Profile data: `content/site.json`

## Frontmatter template

```yaml
---
title: Project Title
slug: project-slug
description: One-line impact summary.
date: "YYYY-MM-DD"
featured: true
tags: ["SQL", "Python"]
tools: ["PostgreSQL", "Tableau"]
metrics:
  - label: Impact metric
    value: "42%"
---
```

## Section checklist

- Problem (business context)
- Data sources
- Approach (methods + tools)
- Key findings (numbered, quantified)
- Outcome (what changed)
- Next steps (optional)

## In-app builder

Users can also create projects at `/admin/builder` during local dev.

See `AGENTS.md` for full agent instructions.
